#: 0c31729d61304bf99e6156e296ede21f 4f4ca2ea3f3740a68ab6229033d7b67e
#: 8c68bf0bf10b4164ad86f99d4756b24b c055cb43996e4e92ac65c12db26df932
#: c99dda28e173431a8b62ea1bc54444b2 e2222fb8746245e3b7c82673792361c6
msgid ""
"The `Intel Aero RTF vehicle <https://software.intel.com/en-us/aero/drone-"
"kit>`__ includes the :ref:`Intel Aero compute board <common-intel-aero-"
"overview>`, `Vision Accessory Kit <https://software.intel.com/en-"
"us/aero/vision-kit>`__ and a `Spektrum DXe transmitter "
"<http://spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdId=SPM1000>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Intel Aero RTF 飞行器 <https://software.intel.com/en-us/aero/drone-kit>`__ 包含 "
":ref:`Intel Aero 计算板 <common-intel-aero-overview>`、`Vision Accessory Kit "
"<https://software.intel.com/en-us/aero/vision-kit>`__ 以及 `Spektrum DXe 遥控器 "
"<http://spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdId=SPM1000>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:13
#: 4bb0cb1c4e2d4673b97239f26c5226f3 4cc7603f077641fb9ad2a27bb20bf251
#: 7898d4faf3a14ca9837fe530073c59b5 bd48051eeafd4bfc9068517022e3e516
#: de24e622111248cab0ee517269213c6f e1d43398b6bf4cf6af033ae58fa50733
msgid ""
"Within the vehicle is an STM32F427V autopilot board which can run ArduPilot "
"(replacing the pre-loaded non-ArduPilot software). In this way, the higher "
"powered :ref:`Intel Aero compute board <common-intel-aero-overview>` is used"
" as a `companion computer <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-"
"computers.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"飞行器内置 STM32F427V 飞控板，可运行 ArduPilot（替换预装的非 ArduPilot 软件）。由此，性能更强的 :ref:`Intel"
" Aero 计算板 <common-intel-aero-overview>` 可作为 `伴飞计算机 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/companion-computers.html>`__ 使用。"

