"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/intel-"
"aero-rtf.param>`__)"
msgstr ""
"可通过 Mission Planner 的完整参数树界面上传默认参数文件（原始参数文件在 `这里 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/intel-"
"aero-rtf.param>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:65
