msgid "Connecting the Transmitter"
msgstr "连接遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-intel-aero-rtf.rst:70
#: cc919615961d4a53af10799a2b520682
msgid ""
"The transmitter that comes with the RTF is an off the shelf DSM-X DXe and a "
"SPM4648 receiver, which is of autobind mode. The transmitter should always "
"be powered on before the receiver (which is normally powered together with "
"the vehicle).  If powered on after the vehicle it won't connect.  To "
"overcome this you can simply disconnect the cable from the receiver, or go "
"through the binding process, which involves powering on the transmitter "
"while holding the \"BIND/PANIC/TRAINER\" button pressed. More information "
"about the binding and connectiong can be found on the `receiver "
"documentation <https://www.horizonhobby.com/pdf/SPM4648-Manual-EN.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"RTF 配套的遥控器是现成的 DSM-X DXe，以及一个 SPM4648 "
"接收机，该接收机采用自动对频模式。遥控器应始终先于接收机（通常随飞行器一起上电）开机。若在飞行器之后开机将无法连接。解决方法是拔下接收机的连接线，或重新执行对频流程——在按住「BIND/PANIC/TRAINER」按钮的同时开启遥控器。更多对频和连接信息请参阅"
" `接收机文档 <https://www.horizonhobby.com/pdf/SPM4648-Manual-EN.pdf>`__。"

